      "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone! Because I know a lot of people have been waiting, I wanted to let you know that some more Spirit Island promo spirits are now<a href=\"https://store.greaterthangames.com/spirit-island-promo-spirit-pack.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"> available on the web store</a>.</p><p><span>I also wanted to let you know that the new adventure for Sentinel Comics: The Role Playing Game, Stolen Legacy, is also available on the web store! You can get <a href=\"https://store.greaterthangames.com/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game-stolen-legacy-one-shot-adventure-digital.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">a digital version for free</a>, or <a href=\"https://store.greaterthangames.com/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game-stolen-legacy-one-shot-adventure.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">a physical version for $9.95</a>&nbsp;(the physical version also comes with a digital download). Stolen Legacy is a long one-shot adventure (3-4 hours of play time), plus character sheets for the new hero team Daybreak.</span></p>",
